            <div xml:id="d900-a2">

                <pb facs="1076" n="980" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg980"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure—translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Vigil to Lord
                            Tweeddale.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-07-11"><hi rendition="#italic">July 11,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Monsieur le Directeur</hi>: I have the honor to
                    inform you that the negotiations conducted between you and me for the reopening
                    of the cable, Hongkong-Manila, have had a favorable result, as, according to a
                    telegram which the director-general of posts and telegraphs has addressed to me
                    on the 9th instant, the Spanish Government intrusts the company, of which you
                    are the worthy director, to take the necessary steps to obtain complete
                    neutralization of the cable, giving you entire independence and freedom from
                    interference on the part of the one or the other of the belligerents, on
                    condition that your office at Manila is considered neutral territory to give
                    free course to all telegrams—official, private, in plain or secret language,
                    whether in code or in figures, without distinction, by senders of all
                    nationalities or addressed to the same.</p>
                <p>I have to request that you will be good enough to inform me what means you
                    propose to adopt to hasten the reopening of communication, and to be kind enough
                    to advise me of the probable date of the reopening of the cable for service.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vigil.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
